(Politically, the Dual Monarchy occupies a middle ground between) Tj T*
(absolutist Russia and constitutional England. The court, the nobility) Tj T*
(and the Roman Church with its strong aristocratic leanings, represent) Tj T*
(the dominant power in Austria. The economic and social changes of the) Tj T*
(transitional period have been accompanied by politico-economic) Tj T*
(struggles which have played a vital part and have cut through and) Tj T*
(across the racial, national and religious conflicts of this) Tj T*
(much-distracted conglomeration of peoples. Amid the confusion of) Tj T*
(parties, with their complexity of programs, may be distinguished the) Tj T*
(German-Austrian liberals, representatives of the middle class or) Tj T*
(industrialists, whose historic mission was to create a modern state) Tj T*
(in Austria, and who carried out, in large measure, their program of) Tj T*
(constitutionalism, economic freedom and the secular state. Against) Tj T*
(them were arrayed the powerful forces of the agrarian party or the) Tj T*
(landed aristocracy--the upholders of the feudal economic-social order) Tj T*
(of privilege and class distinction, the clericals--the upholders of) Tj T*
(the idea of the Christian State--and the representatives of the lower) Tj T*
(middle class, composed chiefly of petty artisans and traders, whose) Tj T*
(ideal was the medieval industrial organization, largely co-operative) Tj T*
(and regulated, as opposed to the individualistic and competitive) Tj T*
(system of the modern era, with its great concentration of wealth,) Tj T*
(capital and power in the hands of the middle class. That the present) Tj T*
(structure of Austria is so much of a compromise and crosspatch between) Tj T*
(modern and medieval economic, social and political forms, and contains) Tj T*
(so much that is essentially incongruous, is due largely to the) Tj T*
(successful struggle which the chief parties of the medieval order--the) Tj T*
(feudal-clericals--the party of the upper classes, and the Christian) Tj T*
(Socialists--the party of the lower classes--have waged against the) Tj T*
(growing constitutionalization, industrialization and secularization of) Tj T*
(Austria--in short, against the transformation of Austria into a modern) Tj T*
(state.) Tj T*
