(countries present points of similarity in their situation and their) Tj T*
(recent movement. In all of these countries, economic and social) Tj T*
(conditions closely resembling those that obtained in the countries of) Tj T*
(Western Europe several centuries ago were found until comparatively) Tj T*
(recent times. The abolition of serfdom in Russia and in Roumania, and) Tj T*
(of feudal dues in Austria-Hungary, paved the way for the entrance of) Tj T*
(these states into modern European civilization. The succeeding period) Tj T*
(has been marked by a rapid transition from the old domestic economy to) Tj T*
(a modern exchange economy, through the growth of industry and) Tj T*
(commerce. The medieval conditions of the earlier period have) Tj T*
(nevertheless not been entirely obliterated. They exist, in Russia, in) Tj T*
(the privileges and powers of the nobility, in the inferior status and) Tj T*
(oppressed condition of the peasantry, in the strong class) Tj T*
(distinctions, in the restraints upon economic activity and upon) Tj T*
(movement. Though in smaller measure, the same conditions are found in) Tj T*
(Austria-Hungary, especially in Galicia. In Roumania, so far as the) Tj T*
(peasantry is concerned, the pre-emancipation conditions remain) Tj T*
(practically, if not legally, in force. Owing to the increase of) Tj T*
(population, the minute subdivision of the estates of the peasants, the) Tj T*
(backwardness of their agricultural methods, and their over-taxation,) Tj T*
(the position of the peasants has been rendered precarious.) Tj T*
(Revolutionary uprisings directed chiefly against the landed) Tj T*
(proprietors have been a recurring expression of their discontent.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(An important consequence has been the rapid evolution of the) Tj T*
(industrial and commercial, or the middle class. The growth of the) Tj T*
(middle class has been accompanied by a struggle in each of these) Tj T*
(countries between the privileged classes of the feudal state and the) Tj T*
(middle class, including in the latter the educated classes and the) Tj T*
(industrial workers of the towns.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
