(occupations and dwelling in villages, the Jews represent an industrial) Tj T*
(and commercial people, strongly concentrated in towns. This economic) Tj T*
(and social position of the Jews is of the greatest significance,) Tj T*
(especially in the present period of transition in these countries.) Tj T*
