(Freedom of movement of the individual is the very essence of the life) Tj T*
(of modern states and the basis of their economic, social and political) Tj T*
(institutions. The lack of this freedom, especially to the extent) Tj T*
(created by the May Laws, bars the Jews from the possibilities of) Tj T*
