(has lost all meaning for the Jews. In this atmosphere they exist) Tj T*
(mainly through bribery, at once their bane and their salvation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The unusual economic and social pressure exerted by the reactionary) Tj T*
(regime upon its Jewish subjects, through the new restrictive laws that) Tj T*
(were put into operation during the last thirty years, the) Tj T*
(administrative harrying that became the order of the day and the) Tj T*
(introduction of the hitherto unused method of physical repression, the) Tj T*
(_pogrom_, becomes clear in the light of its policy. Beginning as a) Tj T*
