(variety of causes.[46] Although one of the least advanced among the) Tj T*
(Austrian crown lands, Galicia has experienced within the last) Tj T*
(half-century an industrial and commercial development along with the) Tj T*
(rest of the Empire. This resulted in the growth of a middle class) Tj T*
