(The preceding analysis of the movement of the Jewish immigration to) Tj T*
(the United States and that of its Russian, Roumanian and) Tj T*
(Austro-Hungarian tributaries, from 1881 to 1910, has revealed certain) Tj T*
(facts of importance.) Tj T*
