(Vital aspects of an immigrant people are revealed in its sex and age) Tj T*
(distribution. Generally speaking, whether an immigration is composed) Tj T*
(of individuals or of families is shown in the relative proportion of) Tj T*
(males and females, and of adults and children, of which it is) Tj T*
(composed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
