(phrase. In view of the facts that have developed, this statement is) Tj T*
(true without any qualification.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This migration-process explains the remarkable growth of the Jewish) Tj T*
(population in the United States, within a relatively short period of) Tj T*
(time. In this transplantation, the spirit of social solidarity and) Tj T*
(communal responsibility prevalent among the Jews has played a vital) Tj T*
(part.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The family rather than the individual thus becomes the unit for the) Tj T*
(social life of the Jewish immigrant population in the United States.) Tj T*
(In this respect the latter approaches more nearly the native American) Tj T*
(population than does the foreign white or immigrant population. One of) Tj T*
(the greatest evils incident to and characteristic of the general) Tj T*
(immigration to this country is thereby minimized.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Again, the concentration of the Jewish immigrants in certain trades) Tj T*
(explains in great measure the peculiarities of the occupational and) Tj T*
(the urban distribution of the Jews in the United States. The) Tj T*
(development of the garment trades through Jewish agencies is largely) Tj T*
(explained by the recruiting of the material for this development) Tj T*
(through these laborers.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(These primary characteristics of the Jewish immigration of the last) Tj T*
(thirty years will serve to explain some of the most important phases) Tj T*
(of the economic and social life of the Jews in the United States,) Tj T*
(three-fourths of whom are immigrants of this period.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Of all the features of this historic movement of the Jews from Eastern) Tj T*
(Europe to the United States, not the least interesting is their) Tj T*
(passing from civilizations whose bonds with their medieval past are) Tj T*
(still strong to a civilization which began its course unhampered by) Tj T*
(tradition and unyoked to the forms and institutions of the past. The) Tj T*
(contrast between the broad freedom of this democracy and the) Tj T*
(intolerable despotism from whose yoke most of them fled, has given) Tj T*
(them a sense of appreciation of American political and social) Tj T*
(institutions that is felt in every movement of their mental life.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(FOOTNOTES:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([140] So strongly was this the case that the Immigration Commission in) Tj T*
(discussing these characteristics was compelled to separate the Jewish) Tj T*
(from the "new" immigration, in order to bring out the essential) Tj T*
(differences of the latter from the "old" immigration.) Tj T*
