() Tj T*
(The banishment, whether by direct decree or by not less certain) Tj T*
(indirect methods, of so large a number of men and women is not a local) Tj T*
(question. A decree to leave one country is in the nature of things an) Tj T*
(order to enter another--some other. This consideration, as well as the) Tj T*
(suggestion of humanity, furnishes ample ground for the remonstrances) Tj T*
(which we have presented to Russia, while our historic friendship for) Tj T*
(that government can not fail to give assurance that our) Tj T*
(representations are those of a sincere wellwisher.) Tj T*
