stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738 Td 13 TL
("The political disabilities of the Jews in Roumania, their exclusion) Tj T*
(from the public service and the learned professions, the limitations) Tj T*
(of their civil rights and the imposition upon them of exceptional) Tj T*
(taxes, involving as they do wrongs repugnant to the moral sense of) Tj T*
(liberal modern peoples, are not so directly in point for my present) Tj T*
(purpose as the public acts which attack the inherent right of man as a) Tj T*
(breadwinner in the ways of agriculture and trade. The Jews are) Tj T*
(prohibited from owning land, or even from cultivating it as common) Tj T*
(laborers. They are debarred from residing in the rural districts. Many) Tj T*
(branches of petty trade and manual production are closed to them in) Tj T*
(the overcrowded cities where they are forced to dwell and engage,) Tj T*
(against fearful odds, in the desperate struggle for existence. Even as) Tj T*
(ordinary artisans or hired laborers they may only find employment in) Tj T*
(proportion of one "unprotected alien" to two "Roumanians" under any) Tj T*
(one employer. In short, by the cumulative effect of successive) Tj T*
(restrictions, the Jews of Roumania have become reduced to a state of) Tj T*
(wretched misery. Shut out from nearly every avenue of self-support) Tj T*
(which is open to the poor of other lands, and ground down by poverty) Tj T*
(as the natural result of their discriminatory treatment, they are) Tj T*
(rendered incapable of lifting themselves from the enforced degradation) Tj T*
(they endure. Even were the fields of education, of civil employment) Tj T*
(and of commerce open to them as to "Roumanian citizens," their penury) Tj T*
(would prevent their rising by individual effort. Human beings so) Tj T*
(circumstanced have virtually no alternatives but submissive suffering) Tj T*
(or flight to some land less unfavorable to them. Removal under such) Tj T*
(conditions is not and cannot be the healthy, intelligent emigration of) Tj T*
(a free and self-reliant being. It must be, in most cases, the mere) Tj T*
(transplantation of an artificially produced diseased growth to a new) Tj T*
(place.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
("Granting that, in better and more healthful surroundings, the morbid) Tj T*
(conditions will eventually change for good, such emigration is) Tj T*
(necessarily for a time a burden to the community upon which the) Tj T*
(fugitives may be cast. Self-reliance and the knowledge and ability) Tj T*
(that evolve the power of self-support must be developed, and, at the) Tj T*
(same time, avenues of employment must be opened in quarters where) Tj T*
(competition is already keen and opportunities scarce. The teachings of) Tj T*
(history and the experience of our own nation show that the Jews) Tj T*
(possess in a high degree the mental and moral qualifications of) Tj T*
(conscientious citizenhood. No class of immigrants is more welcome to) Tj T*
(our shores, when coming equipped in mind and body for entrance upon) Tj T*
(the struggle for bread, and inspired with the high purpose to give the) Tj T*
(best service of heart and brain to the land they adopt of their own) Tj T*
(free will. But when they come as outcasts, made doubly paupers by) Tj T*
(physical and moral oppression in their native land, and thrown upon) Tj T*
(the long-suffering generosity of a more favored community, their) Tj T*
(migration lacks the essential conditions which make alien immigration) Tj T*
(either acceptable or beneficial. So well is this appreciated on the) Tj T*
(Continent that, even in the countries where anti-Semitism has no) Tj T*
(foothold, it is difficult for these fleeing Jews to obtain any) Tj T*
(lodgment. America is their only goal.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
